      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tarehe mirongo miiri na mwenga mwezi wa sabaa, Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba tsona kutsupira kpwa nabii Hagai achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gomba na liwali wa Juda, Zerubabeli mwana wa Shealitieli na mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu, Joshuwa mwana wa Jehosadaki na hinyo atu anjina osi a Mlungu uauze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezira 3:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Dze phana mutu achiyesala kahi yenu ariyeona nguma ya nyumba hino yokala hipho mwandzo? Na vino munaionadze? Dze, taionekana avi si chitu?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi anaamba, ‘Dina uwe Zerubabeli. Uwe mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu Joshuwa mwana wa Jehosadaki nawe piya dina. Atu osi a tsi hino namwi dinani. Mosi endererani kuhenda kazi mana mimi ni phamwenga namwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.45+EXO.29.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 29:45–46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama dza viratu nrivyolagana namwi wakati mriphokala munatuluka Misiri, Roho yangu ichere phamwenga namwi, kpwa hivyo msiogophe.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
